y showing a narrow Conley lead and partisan polls diverging.\n\nMoney is not a differentiator: both candidates have raised about $10 million, though Lawler holds a cash-on-hand edge and recently drew a $500,000 outside boost from Elon Musk's super PAC, while Conley has union backing and heavy Democratic outside spending. In a favorable midterm climate for Democrats, the race leans narrowly toward Conley, but Lawler's incumbency keeps it highly competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7399, "margin": 4.04}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7185, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6936, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7094, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6393, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6716, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7011, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7074, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6916, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7111, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6963, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6942, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6864, "margin": 2.4}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6531, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6293, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6259, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6602, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6266, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6307, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6323, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.6967, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6643, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6625, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.6267, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.6228, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.6522, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.6346, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "20